        {
          "id": "31507dc6-53af-4d75-9199-f49d1e27b56c",
          "type": "storyParagraph",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "speed": 0,
            "isFirst": true
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "本故事以《左傳》為本，人物心緒與部分情節為合理虛構，請小心甄別",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1b8fd071-0685-4419-affc-eed112f655dc",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「夜縋而出。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "0d4c447d-685e-4f42-8da2-b7956268bed4",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "——《左傳·僖公三十年》。四個字，寫的是一個七十歲的人，被一條繩子從城牆上放下去。[wait=500] 史官沒有寫那條繩子有多長，[wait=250] 也沒有寫他的手抖不抖。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "fa4a113b-88ef-4844-91cc-61543b164c6e",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「剪裁得當」。[wait=1000]後世學者是這麼論斷的。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "dc4fd25a-7d98-4e09-8f97-ab9aa8665df5",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "史書只給了他一夜。[wait=600]這一夜之前的七十年，一個字也沒有；這一夜之後，他的名字再沒有出現過。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "18d4281b-e375-4e4e-b96a-9cbc32279501",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你要走的，是那七十年——以及那七十年，是怎麼變成那一夜的。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
